1
00:01:28,191 --> 00:01:34,030
RYOTSU AND REIKO TOGETHER... FOREVER?

2
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:40,136
Are those the newest model of handcuffs?

3
00:01:41,871 --> 00:01:45,842
They're lightweight, compact, and stronger than steel.

4
00:01:46,042 --> 00:01:48,044
How do you use them?

5
00:01:48,244 --> 00:01:50,079
Give me your hand.

6
00:01:50,446 --> 00:01:54,350
If you touch the inner surface even a little bit,

7
00:01:55,451 --> 00:01:57,520
they lock automatically.

8
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,621
Wow...

9
00:01:58,855 --> 00:02:02,091
You open them with this electronic key.

10
00:02:03,826 --> 00:02:06,162
-See? -Amazing! It's very fast.

11
00:02:06,362 --> 00:02:09,265
This will make it much easier to arrest criminals.

12
00:02:10,466 --> 00:02:13,169
Finally, the morning shift guys are here.

13
00:02:13,369 --> 00:02:15,938
It was a tough night shift.

14
00:02:17,940 --> 00:02:20,610
You look very sleepy, Ryo-chan.

15
00:02:20,843 --> 00:02:23,312
I'm way beyond just being sleepy, seriously.

16
00:02:25,615 --> 00:02:28,484
Five days ago, I went to the beach for a few days.

17
00:02:28,718 --> 00:02:32,789
We stayed up till morning every night drinking, singing, and having fun.

18
00:02:33,022 --> 00:02:36,859
After that, we played mahjong for 70 hours straight.

19
00:02:37,226 --> 00:02:40,029
Then I went straight into this night shift.

20
00:02:40,229 --> 00:02:43,132
I haven't slept for about 120 hours.

21
00:02:43,332 --> 00:02:44,600
That's crazy!

22
00:02:45,868 --> 00:02:48,237
I'll sleep about 100 hours when I get home today.

23
00:02:48,438 --> 00:02:49,305
I'm so tired.

24
00:02:49,505 --> 00:02:52,108
You need to change your lifestyle.

25
00:02:52,909 --> 00:02:55,445
That's too much to ask of me.

26
00:02:56,279 --> 00:02:57,113
What're those?

27
00:02:57,613 --> 00:03:00,083
You mean these? A new type of handcuffs.

28
00:03:01,517 --> 00:03:04,620
See? They lock in just 0.2 seconds.

29
00:03:04,821 --> 00:03:08,057
Oh, interesting! All you have to do is just touch it.

30
00:03:08,257 --> 00:03:09,692
That's convenient.

31
00:03:09,926 --> 00:03:11,327
It opens with this key.

32
00:03:15,298 --> 00:03:16,332
Cool!

33
00:03:19,235 --> 00:03:21,938
This is fun! So fast.

34
00:03:23,272 --> 00:03:25,708
He looked so sleepy a few minutes ago.

35
00:03:25,942 --> 00:03:29,545
He loves toys more than anything.

36
00:03:29,779 --> 00:03:32,114
The shift handover is done, so let's go home.

37
00:03:32,315 --> 00:03:34,851
Wait a minute. I want these.

38
00:03:35,084 --> 00:03:37,353
If you're tired, you should hurry home and sleep.

39
00:03:37,553 --> 00:03:38,621
You're like a kid.

40
00:03:39,188 --> 00:03:40,289
What?

41
00:03:40,490 --> 00:03:43,626
Sorry for being a kid! You're under arrest!

42
00:03:45,661 --> 00:03:47,497
What are you doing?

43
00:03:49,966 --> 00:03:50,800
Oh, the key!

44
00:03:56,205 --> 00:03:57,140
He ate it!

45
00:03:58,407 --> 00:03:59,308
Hey!

46
00:04:04,347 --> 00:04:06,115
Damn it, he's gone!

47
00:04:07,817 --> 00:04:08,851
What do we do with these?

48
00:04:09,051 --> 00:04:10,353
I don't know.

49
00:04:10,553 --> 00:04:12,388
Hey, do something, Nakagawa.

50
00:04:12,822 --> 00:04:16,559
Don't look at me. It's Terai-san who borrowed them from HQ.

51
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:19,061
Y-Yes, I'll make inquiries.

52
00:04:19,295 --> 00:04:20,863
There must be a spare key.

53
00:04:23,165 --> 00:04:25,167
Yes, that's right.

54
00:04:26,068 --> 00:04:29,372
It's because you shouted that the dog ran away.

55
00:04:29,572 --> 00:04:31,440
You should have caught it quietly.

56
00:04:31,674 --> 00:04:34,443
You're the one who caused me to drop the key!

57
00:04:35,144 --> 00:04:37,747
What? I got it, yes.

58
00:04:38,514 --> 00:04:42,418
We have a big problem. The person in charge has gone on vacation.

59
00:04:42,618 --> 00:04:44,387
Eh? What the heck!

60
00:04:44,587 --> 00:04:45,588
When are they back?

61
00:04:45,788 --> 00:04:47,723
Not till the day after tomorrow.

62
00:04:47,924 --> 00:04:52,361
What? You mean I have to stay stuck to Reiko for the next 48 hours?

63
00:04:52,562 --> 00:04:54,363
It's worse for me.

64
00:04:54,564 --> 00:04:57,867
Wait, is it Saturday today?

65
00:04:58,067 --> 00:04:59,201
Yes, it is.

66
00:04:59,402 --> 00:05:01,037
You've got to be kidding.

67
00:05:01,537 --> 00:05:03,439
It's horse racing day!

68
00:05:05,408 --> 00:05:06,442
There's no time for this.

69
00:05:06,642 --> 00:05:09,045
Damn, I have to do something.

70
00:05:11,080 --> 00:05:14,116
This new model is tough. Not a scratch on them.

71
00:05:14,350 --> 00:05:18,221
Jeez, I had a bad feeling when you were playing with them.

72
00:05:18,754 --> 00:05:22,225
Sorry, but I have something to do, so I'm heading home.

73
00:05:22,625 --> 00:05:25,595
Eh, what? Hey, wait!

74
00:05:25,795 --> 00:05:28,631
Ryo-chan, you'll have to work with me.

75
00:05:28,831 --> 00:05:30,666
What? Hey!

76
00:05:31,434 --> 00:05:34,904
Wait a minute. I told you I haven't slept for 120 hours.

77
00:05:35,104 --> 00:05:37,273
You can't make me work another eight hours!

78
00:05:37,473 --> 00:05:38,975
You have no choice.

79
00:05:39,208 --> 00:05:41,077
Hey, today is my day off!

80
00:05:41,277 --> 00:05:42,478
Why do I have to work?

81
00:05:43,112 --> 00:05:44,914
Okay then, do as you like.

82
00:05:45,114 --> 00:05:47,583
Damn right I will.

83
00:05:48,250 --> 00:05:49,986
I'm going to sleep.

84
00:05:51,988 --> 00:05:54,457
Wow! It took less than a second.

85
00:05:54,657 --> 00:05:58,761
He can sleep anywhere, just like an animal.

86
00:06:01,397 --> 00:06:03,966
Yes, this is Kameari Park Police Station.

87
00:06:04,166 --> 00:06:05,134
Yes, she's here.

88
00:06:05,768 --> 00:06:07,637
Reiko-san, there's a call from HQ.

89
00:06:08,004 --> 00:06:09,272
For me?

90
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:13,142
Ouch! You woke me up!

91
00:06:13,342 --> 00:06:14,710
Come over here for a second.

92
00:06:14,944 --> 00:06:16,612
Hey, hey!

93
00:06:16,812 --> 00:06:18,014
Yes, this is Reiko.

94
00:06:18,614 --> 00:06:19,482
Okay.

95
00:06:19,682 --> 00:06:22,685
Huh? Go to HQ at once?

96
00:06:22,885 --> 00:06:24,620
Yes, I got it.

97
00:06:27,156 --> 00:06:28,891
My head is getting burnt!

98
00:06:29,125 --> 00:06:31,427
Hey, stop!

99
00:06:32,561 --> 00:06:33,996
What are you doing?

100
00:06:34,196 --> 00:06:35,665
We're going to HQ.

101
00:06:35,998 --> 00:06:38,000
No. I'm off duty.

102
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,502
I refuse to go.

103
00:06:42,038 --> 00:06:43,673
What are you doing?

104
00:06:44,540 --> 00:06:46,375
He said it's urgent.

105
00:06:46,575 --> 00:06:47,677
Hey!

106
00:06:48,110 --> 00:06:48,911
Here we go!

107
00:06:49,145 --> 00:06:51,280
Jeez, wait...

108
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:53,382
Hey, Reiko!

109
00:06:53,716 --> 00:06:56,052
Why do I have to run?

110
00:06:56,385 --> 00:06:59,555
It can't be helped. Riding double on a moped is prohibited.

111
00:06:59,922 --> 00:07:01,590
I'll speed up. Try to keep up.

112
00:07:01,824 --> 00:07:03,059
Stop!

113
00:07:06,929 --> 00:07:09,732
"KATSUSHIKA POLICE HEADQUARTERS"

114
00:07:13,035 --> 00:07:15,237
You got tired already? That was nothing!

115
00:07:15,738 --> 00:07:16,605
What the heck?

116
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:19,942
That was definitely a new world record!

117
00:07:20,176 --> 00:07:21,510
Take my arm properly.

118
00:07:23,412 --> 00:07:25,781
It'll be embarrassing if anyone finds out.

119
00:07:26,515 --> 00:07:28,617
They're a daring couple.

120
00:07:28,851 --> 00:07:31,220
A real-life Beauty and the Beast.

121
00:07:32,621 --> 00:07:33,889
Stop here.

122
00:07:34,090 --> 00:07:35,224
Huh? Why?

123
00:07:36,158 --> 00:07:37,193
This way.

124
00:07:37,393 --> 00:07:38,494
I gotta pee.

125
00:07:38,694 --> 00:07:39,895
What!

126
00:07:41,163 --> 00:07:42,698
I can't go in there with you.

127
00:07:43,232 --> 00:07:44,433
You can't not go!

128
00:07:44,633 --> 00:07:46,702
What do you want me to do? I'll wet my pants!

129
00:07:47,036 --> 00:07:48,537
What should I do?

130
00:07:49,038 --> 00:07:50,339
Oh, I know!

131
00:07:50,806 --> 00:07:52,942
Why don't you do it in the backyard?

132
00:07:53,209 --> 00:07:55,244
You want me to pee outside behind HQ?

133
00:07:55,444 --> 00:07:56,712
Shhh!

134
00:07:57,446 --> 00:07:59,215
However...

135
00:08:02,418 --> 00:08:04,186
I can't hold it anymore.

136
00:08:04,987 --> 00:08:06,222
Hurry up.

137
00:08:07,456 --> 00:08:10,359
I can't stand it. What did I do to deserve this?

138
00:08:10,559 --> 00:08:11,727
Reiko-san!

139
00:08:11,927 --> 00:08:14,230
What are you doing there?

140
00:08:14,597 --> 00:08:16,532
Well, I'm sunbathing.

141
00:08:16,732 --> 00:08:18,601
Oh, that's not like you.

142
00:08:18,801 --> 00:08:20,603
Let's play volleyball together.

143
00:08:20,803 --> 00:08:21,670
No, stop!

144
00:08:21,904 --> 00:08:23,272
I'm not ready!

145
00:08:24,006 --> 00:08:25,474
Ouch! Hey!

146
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:34,083
Pervert!

147
00:08:37,153 --> 00:08:38,320
I said I wasn't ready!

148
00:08:38,554 --> 00:08:40,656
You see that? They think I'm a pervert.

149
00:08:40,856 --> 00:08:42,558
I can't take it anymore.

150
00:08:43,926 --> 00:08:45,294
Well, excuse me then.

151
00:08:45,494 --> 00:08:47,263
Thank you for coming.

152
00:08:49,932 --> 00:08:51,167
R-Ryo-chan.

153
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,435
You've done what you came for, right?

154
00:08:53,636 --> 00:08:54,637
Let's go back.

155
00:08:55,004 --> 00:08:56,105
Well...

156
00:08:56,672 --> 00:08:58,841
What, the bathroom?

157
00:08:59,041 --> 00:09:02,645
If I go in there with you, I'll be a real pervert.

158
00:09:03,179 --> 00:09:06,048
Do it outside like I did. I'll close my eyes.

159
00:09:06,282 --> 00:09:08,584
There's no way I can do that!

160
00:09:08,784 --> 00:09:10,853
Then hold it till we get back to the station.

161
00:09:11,821 --> 00:09:13,856
There is one way to do it.

162
00:09:14,457 --> 00:09:15,791
What do we do?

163
00:09:15,991 --> 00:09:17,159
Go like this...

164
00:09:17,359 --> 00:09:18,861
Then like this!

165
00:09:26,368 --> 00:09:29,004
I can't live like this anymore.

166
00:09:29,205 --> 00:09:31,807
I'll be treated like a pervert too.

167
00:09:37,146 --> 00:09:40,649
Oh, I'm so tired. My left hand hurts.

168
00:09:40,850 --> 00:09:42,685
I'm tired, too.

169
00:09:42,885 --> 00:09:45,621
I haven't had enough sleep, and you're pulling me around.

170
00:09:46,555 --> 00:09:49,458
I got sweaty. I'll take a bath.

171
00:09:49,658 --> 00:09:51,227
What, a bath?

172
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:52,761
Oh, no problem.

173
00:09:52,995 --> 00:09:54,997
I'll make sure not to look.

174
00:09:55,397 --> 00:09:56,565
What's that expression for?

175
00:09:56,765 --> 00:09:58,500
I'd never do something pervy!

176
00:09:59,502 --> 00:10:00,669
Ryo-chan...

177
00:10:02,404 --> 00:10:04,406
Just in case.

178
00:10:10,212 --> 00:10:13,115
Damn it. You knocked me out again.

179
00:10:13,349 --> 00:10:16,118
Don't hit me every time you change clothes or go to the bathroom.

180
00:10:16,352 --> 00:10:18,520
You're getting more resistant.

181
00:10:18,721 --> 00:10:20,556
You regained consciousness faster.

182
00:10:21,090 --> 00:10:23,058
Don't talk about me like I'm a cockroach!

183
00:10:23,726 --> 00:10:25,561
You're not the only one who needs a bath.

184
00:10:25,761 --> 00:10:26,862
Let me in the tub.

185
00:10:27,062 --> 00:10:28,664
Wait, I'll get out soon.

186
00:10:28,864 --> 00:10:30,132
No, right now.

187
00:10:32,067 --> 00:10:34,036
Don't get naked here.

188
00:10:34,236 --> 00:10:36,205
If you're getting in, keep your clothes on.

189
00:10:36,405 --> 00:10:37,439
Don't be ridiculous.

190
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,875
&lt;i&gt;Dang it.&lt;/i&gt;

191
00:10:41,877 --> 00:10:46,882
But how did you get changed with your hand tied?

192
00:10:47,082 --> 00:10:50,452
Uh, well... just a little trick.

193
00:10:53,622 --> 00:10:55,224
Ah, I feel refreshed.

194
00:10:55,424 --> 00:10:58,994
Well, I'm not refreshed at all.

195
00:10:59,595 --> 00:11:02,131
That's because you took a bath with your clothes on.

196
00:11:02,364 --> 00:11:04,466
You told me to do so!

197
00:11:05,301 --> 00:11:07,136
Oh, who could it be at this time?

198
00:11:09,171 --> 00:11:10,839
Akimoto-san.

199
00:11:11,073 --> 00:11:12,608
The caretaker.

200
00:11:12,808 --> 00:11:15,444
She's famous for talking too much.

201
00:11:15,811 --> 00:11:20,149
If she sees us like this, who knows what rumors will spread?

202
00:11:20,382 --> 00:11:22,251
I don't care what people say.

203
00:11:22,451 --> 00:11:24,086
I do care!

204
00:11:24,286 --> 00:11:25,721
Akimoto-san.

205
00:11:25,921 --> 00:11:28,991
Akimoto-san, are you there?

206
00:11:29,191 --> 00:11:30,559
Coming.

207
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:32,561
Sorry to keep you waiting.

208
00:11:32,761 --> 00:11:34,096
Oh, you were in the bath?

209
00:11:34,296 --> 00:11:36,098
A package came for you.

210
00:11:36,298 --> 00:11:38,300
Thank you. Well then...

211
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:42,304
By the way, do you know the girl in apartment eight?

212
00:11:42,504 --> 00:11:45,307
I don't really like gossip,

213
00:11:45,507 --> 00:11:50,212
but that girl brings a different man home every single day.

214
00:11:50,446 --> 00:11:53,482
She has no principles. And she's a total bimbo.

215
00:11:55,985 --> 00:11:58,187
Is that how girls are these days?

216
00:11:58,420 --> 00:12:01,590
Compared to them, a girl like you is unusual.

217
00:12:01,790 --> 00:12:03,959
No weird guys are hanging around you...

218
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:06,862
&lt;i&gt;Ugh, this is tough.&lt;/i&gt;

219
00:12:15,037 --> 00:12:16,538
Now it's time to go to bed.

220
00:12:16,772 --> 00:12:19,708
I'll put on my nightie...

221
00:12:19,908 --> 00:12:20,876
Oh!

222
00:12:21,610 --> 00:12:23,812
He fell asleep before I could hit him.

223
00:12:24,013 --> 00:12:26,181
You're gonna catch a cold if you sleep there.

224
00:12:29,351 --> 00:12:33,622
No wonder. He's been awake for 135 hours.

225
00:12:35,891 --> 00:12:36,725
Hello.

226
00:12:36,925 --> 00:12:39,995
&lt;i&gt;This is your daddy, Pyunpyunmaru!&lt;/i&gt;

227
00:12:40,729 --> 00:12:42,731
What's up, Dad, at this hour?

228
00:12:42,931 --> 00:12:45,234
I'm on my way to you.

229
00:12:47,670 --> 00:12:50,472
Oh, you're coming to Tokyo. Why?

230
00:12:51,106 --> 00:12:53,342
A matchmaking date? Nobody told me!

231
00:12:53,809 --> 00:12:54,877
That's strange.

232
00:12:55,077 --> 00:12:56,845
Anyway, it's at 13:00 tomorrow.

233
00:12:57,046 --> 00:13:00,849
He's the heir to Tenkamaru Corporation, an important client of mine.

234
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:03,085
But it's so sudden.

235
00:13:03,285 --> 00:13:06,055
And I don't want to get married yet.

236
00:13:06,755 --> 00:13:08,390
&lt;i&gt;Is there someone you like?&lt;/i&gt;

237
00:13:08,590 --> 00:13:09,758
It's not like that.

238
00:13:09,958 --> 00:13:12,494
Chief, it's not my fault.

239
00:13:13,362 --> 00:13:15,431
Reiko, what's that man's voice?

240
00:13:15,664 --> 00:13:18,200
No Dad, it's the TV.

241
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:19,735
Jeez, Ryo-chan.

242
00:13:20,502 --> 00:13:21,770
Oh, it was the TV.

243
00:13:21,970 --> 00:13:23,739
&lt;i&gt;Stop, Reiko. Don't.&lt;/i&gt;

244
00:13:24,106 --> 00:13:25,541
&lt;i&gt;I heard him say "Reiko"...&lt;/i&gt;

245
00:13:25,741 --> 00:13:27,776
-Oh, it's the TV. &lt;i&gt;-But...&lt;/i&gt;

246
00:13:27,976 --> 00:13:29,611
A-All right. See you tomorrow.

247
00:13:29,845 --> 00:13:31,213
Good night.

248
00:13:32,581 --> 00:13:33,716
What shall I do?

249
00:13:33,916 --> 00:13:36,952
If I take Ryo-chan like this, it'll be a big fuss.

250
00:13:37,152 --> 00:13:39,221
Dad might collapse from the shock.

251
00:13:42,157 --> 00:13:43,725
"TOKYO DELUXE HOTEL FOR THE WEALTHY"

252
00:13:50,599 --> 00:13:53,769
She should be here any minute. I'm sorry.

253
00:13:54,236 --> 00:13:57,906
No. I don't mind a slight delay at all.

254
00:13:58,107 --> 00:14:01,710
For Reiko-san, I'd wait for hours.

255
00:14:02,411 --> 00:14:03,245
Right, Dad?

256
00:14:03,445 --> 00:14:04,880
Absolutely.

257
00:14:05,948 --> 00:14:06,982
Excuse me.

258
00:14:07,182 --> 00:14:09,151
Oh, it must be Reiko-san.

259
00:14:09,818 --> 00:14:11,820
Thank you for waiting.

260
00:14:14,089 --> 00:14:17,326
I'm sorry. I got stuck in traffic.

261
00:14:17,993 --> 00:14:20,796
Let me put him down here.

262
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:26,368
Isn't he cute?

263
00:14:26,602 --> 00:14:30,506
I love him so much that he's always with me wherever I go.

264
00:14:32,107 --> 00:14:34,743
&lt;i&gt;Ryo-chan has been sleeping since yesterday.&lt;/i&gt;

265
00:14:34,943 --> 00:14:38,847
&lt;i&gt;If he just stays asleep, everything will be fine.&lt;/i&gt;

266
00:14:40,215 --> 00:14:42,451
Reiko-san, you have a cute side.

267
00:14:42,651 --> 00:14:44,620
I like that about you.

268
00:14:44,820 --> 00:14:45,854
Oh, thank you.

269
00:14:46,855 --> 00:14:49,625
As you probably know, I'm Daisuke Tenkamaru,

270
00:14:49,825 --> 00:14:51,827
the heir to the Tenkamaru Corporation.

271
00:14:52,528 --> 00:14:56,799
It's a pleasure to be associated with Akimoto Trading.

272
00:14:56,999 --> 00:14:58,367
It's nice to meet you.

273
00:15:00,669 --> 00:15:02,404
W-Well, what's your hobby?

274
00:15:02,838 --> 00:15:04,006
Spending money.

275
00:15:04,206 --> 00:15:07,810
I have so much money that it's hard to spend it.

276
00:15:09,945 --> 00:15:12,381
That's a fine hobby.

277
00:15:12,881 --> 00:15:15,551
What's yours, Reiko-san? I guess...

278
00:15:15,784 --> 00:15:16,385
Oww!

279
00:15:17,653 --> 00:15:18,720
Ah, it hurts...

280
00:15:19,154 --> 00:15:22,224
Oh, poor thing! Did you fall?

281
00:15:22,791 --> 00:15:24,092
Did it just say "oww"?

282
00:15:24,326 --> 00:15:26,428
I-I said "how nice to meet you."

283
00:15:26,662 --> 00:15:29,364
Oh, I'm honored.

284
00:15:30,866 --> 00:15:33,235
Will you excuse me one moment?

285
00:15:36,104 --> 00:15:37,673
That's the situation.

286
00:15:38,373 --> 00:15:42,377
So that's why I'm dressed in this raccoon dog costume.

287
00:15:42,578 --> 00:15:44,446
Hey, Ryo-chan, please.

288
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:47,583
Don't let them find out until the matchmaking date is over.

289
00:15:48,217 --> 00:15:52,087
Do you like guys with stupid faces like that?

290
00:15:52,855 --> 00:15:54,556
No, I don't!

291
00:15:54,756 --> 00:15:57,359
His father is an important business partner of my dad.

292
00:15:57,559 --> 00:16:01,096
If it goes well, I'll buy you that radio-controlled helicopter you want.

293
00:16:01,697 --> 00:16:03,198
The RC?

294
00:16:03,398 --> 00:16:06,235
Okay, it's a deal. Leave it to me!

295
00:16:07,703 --> 00:16:11,607
I heard your daughter is a police officer.

296
00:16:13,942 --> 00:16:18,280
Even though it's for that RC, it's pretty hard to stay still.

297
00:16:20,616 --> 00:16:23,151
Looks delicious. There's booze, too.

298
00:16:23,952 --> 00:16:26,888
Oh right, I still haven't eaten anything since last night.

299
00:16:27,222 --> 00:16:29,157
Okay, just watch.

300
00:16:30,092 --> 00:16:32,494
After all, the first head of the Tenkamaru family

301
00:16:32,728 --> 00:16:36,632
was Japan's ancient queen Himiko's mother's sister's...

302
00:16:36,865 --> 00:16:38,333
&lt;i&gt;For crying out loud, Ryo-chan.&lt;/i&gt;

303
00:16:38,567 --> 00:16:40,569
Heh, this is child's play.

304
00:16:41,703 --> 00:16:42,938
Reiko-san.

305
00:16:43,138 --> 00:16:43,972
Y-Yes.

306
00:16:44,439 --> 00:16:48,510
If you were to get married, where would you like to live?

307
00:16:48,744 --> 00:16:51,313
A luxury neighborhood like Ashiya or Denenchofu?

308
00:16:51,513 --> 00:16:53,315
Oh, no, not really. Anywhere.

309
00:16:53,649 --> 00:16:57,319
Is that so? I'm fine with anywhere except for old-town areas.

310
00:16:57,519 --> 00:16:58,587
What?

311
00:16:58,787 --> 00:17:01,256
No, hold on. It's for the RC.

312
00:17:01,456 --> 00:17:04,826
You know, they are kind of old-fashioned and have rough vibes.

313
00:17:05,060 --> 00:17:07,129
Damn, how dare you!

314
00:17:07,329 --> 00:17:09,965
I've never liked places like that.

315
00:17:10,599 --> 00:17:13,769
They're crude, and I really can't stand them.

316
00:17:13,969 --> 00:17:15,971
Reiko-san, what do you think?

317
00:17:17,506 --> 00:17:19,174
Ah, so good...

318
00:17:28,283 --> 00:17:30,218
Water! Water!

319
00:17:30,452 --> 00:17:32,854
Give me some water!

320
00:17:41,964 --> 00:17:44,099
-Oh, Dai-chan! -Daisuke-kun!

321
00:17:49,404 --> 00:17:51,106
Sorry about that.

322
00:17:52,007 --> 00:17:54,576
Shall we talk somewhere, just the two of us?

323
00:17:54,810 --> 00:17:58,246
Oh, good idea. Let the young ones be with each other.

324
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,581
Right, Tenkamaru-san?

325
00:17:59,815 --> 00:18:01,350
I agree.

326
00:18:06,655 --> 00:18:07,989
-Reiko-san. -Yes.

327
00:18:08,190 --> 00:18:10,225
We're finally alone together.

328
00:18:10,425 --> 00:18:11,526
Y-Yes...

329
00:18:11,727 --> 00:18:15,063
Reiko-san, from the first moment I saw you...

330
00:18:15,397 --> 00:18:16,498
Um...

331
00:18:17,065 --> 00:18:18,834
Reiko-san...

332
00:18:19,735 --> 00:18:22,971
We can see the Dragon King show over there!

333
00:18:23,171 --> 00:18:24,673
What, the Dragon King?

334
00:18:36,551 --> 00:18:39,154
Did I imagine it? Or was that raccoon dog running?

335
00:18:39,354 --> 00:18:40,889
Dragon King!

336
00:18:41,089 --> 00:18:42,157
Dragon Queen!

337
00:18:42,357 --> 00:18:43,458
Dragon Jack!

338
00:18:43,692 --> 00:18:45,627
Dragon Three!

339
00:18:55,570 --> 00:18:58,607
Once in a while, this kind of thing is fun.

340
00:18:58,840 --> 00:18:59,908
Y-Yes.

341
00:19:00,475 --> 00:19:02,711
&lt;i&gt;Now, casually, with my hand...&lt;/i&gt;

342
00:19:03,178 --> 00:19:04,613
Way to go, Dragon King.

343
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:06,782
Now, Dragon Kick!

344
00:19:08,450 --> 00:19:10,385
Oh, what's wrong?

345
00:19:12,721 --> 00:19:13,922
Oh, nothing.

346
00:19:14,656 --> 00:19:16,224
&lt;i&gt;That's weird.&lt;/i&gt;

347
00:19:16,625 --> 00:19:18,593
&lt;i&gt;Calm down. Calm down.&lt;/i&gt;

348
00:19:19,428 --> 00:19:20,662
Dragon Chop!

349
00:19:24,266 --> 00:19:25,634
Hot, hot, hot!

350
00:19:28,403 --> 00:19:30,272
Ah, fire!

351
00:19:32,874 --> 00:19:34,509
Ouch! Hot! Hot!

352
00:19:35,043 --> 00:19:37,579
I'm like the raccoon dog from the &lt;i&gt;Kachi-kachi Yama&lt;/i&gt; tale!

353
00:19:37,913 --> 00:19:39,247
Ryo-chan, a pond!

354
00:19:39,748 --> 00:19:41,249
Thank goodness!

355
00:19:44,786 --> 00:19:46,488
Very shallow.

356
00:19:48,890 --> 00:19:50,659
It's not all bad.

357
00:19:51,093 --> 00:19:53,128
At least half of your face was safe.

358
00:19:53,328 --> 00:19:54,262
Damn it.

359
00:19:54,463 --> 00:19:56,131
But we're gonna get in trouble.

360
00:19:56,465 --> 00:19:58,633
Reiko-san! Reiko-san!

361
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,669
What should we do? He'll find us!

362
00:20:00,902 --> 00:20:02,971
There's nothing we can do...

363
00:20:03,605 --> 00:20:05,507
Reiko-san, where are you?

364
00:20:11,079 --> 00:20:12,781
What a wimp.

365
00:20:12,981 --> 00:20:15,083
Oh, there you are.

366
00:20:15,283 --> 00:20:17,152
It's your turn. Hurry up!

367
00:20:17,352 --> 00:20:18,186
What is it?

368
00:20:18,954 --> 00:20:20,122
Get on the stage!

369
00:20:24,693 --> 00:20:26,795
There you are, General Devil!

370
00:20:27,863 --> 00:20:29,965
Who is that girl?

371
00:20:30,832 --> 00:20:33,468
Dragon King! I'm a huge fan.

372
00:20:36,705 --> 00:20:38,306
Hold it, Pink Devil Squad!

373
00:20:40,142 --> 00:20:41,943
Take this!

374
00:20:49,317 --> 00:20:52,687
General Devil beat up the Pink Devils!

375
00:20:53,021 --> 00:20:54,389
What are you doing, you idiot?

376
00:20:55,023 --> 00:20:56,892
-Reiko, you do it, too! -Huh?

377
00:20:57,392 --> 00:20:59,895
Ouch! What the hell? That guy's really serious!

378
00:21:00,128 --> 00:21:02,531
If he wants to fight for real, let's do it!

379
00:21:02,731 --> 00:21:03,565
Yeah!

380
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:07,435
Jeez! I have no choice.

381
00:21:19,981 --> 00:21:20,849
They love it...

382
00:21:21,349 --> 00:21:24,152
Good, everyone attack those two.

383
00:21:24,452 --> 00:21:25,854
Go on!

384
00:21:33,428 --> 00:21:34,696
Reiko-san!

385
00:21:34,896 --> 00:21:36,765
Where in the world did they go?

386
00:21:43,405 --> 00:21:44,272
R-Reiko-san.

387
00:21:44,472 --> 00:21:47,075
How cool she is... Reiko-san!

388
00:21:47,409 --> 00:21:48,577
Reiko-san!

389
00:21:49,477 --> 00:21:50,912
What are you doing?

390
00:21:56,184 --> 00:22:00,622
She seems a little unsuitable for the Tenkamaru family.

391
00:22:05,126 --> 00:22:07,095
The rest was a mess.

392
00:22:07,829 --> 00:22:10,265
But it was a relief to finally get the cuffs off.

393
00:22:10,465 --> 00:22:13,602
Honestly, I went through all this just because of these handcuffs.

394
00:22:13,935 --> 00:22:17,138
Still, maybe you were lucky.

395
00:22:17,372 --> 00:22:20,108
The person in charge is on a business trip for a month from today.

396
00:22:20,675 --> 00:22:23,144
A month? That was close!

397
00:22:23,378 --> 00:22:25,313
By the way, how did the matchmaking date go?

398
00:22:25,814 --> 00:22:28,950
I'm sure he turned her down.

399
00:22:31,086 --> 00:22:31,920
This is...

400
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:33,955
Yes, the RC chopper as promised.

401
00:22:34,155 --> 00:22:35,290
Great!

402
00:22:35,490 --> 00:22:37,826
So, did the matchmaking date go well?

403
00:22:38,293 --> 00:22:41,863
Nah. I have no intention of getting married anyway.

404
00:22:42,097 --> 00:22:44,232
I went on the date so my dad could save face.

405
00:22:44,432 --> 00:22:47,869
But it's a relief not to have to turn down such a jerk.

406
00:22:48,103 --> 00:22:49,104
Thanks, Ryo-chan.

407
00:22:49,504 --> 00:22:51,940
I knew that's what you were thinking.

408
00:22:53,608 --> 00:22:55,877
These cuffs came in handy after all.

409
00:22:57,178 --> 00:22:58,013
Ryotsu.

410
00:22:58,246 --> 00:22:59,080
C-Chief!

411
00:22:59,881 --> 00:23:01,249
Good morning, sir.

412
00:23:01,449 --> 00:23:04,552
You're going to play with a toy on duty again, aren't you?

413
00:23:05,353 --> 00:23:06,321
Oh no, sir.

414
00:23:06,521 --> 00:23:08,823
I'm always focused on my work.

415
00:23:09,024 --> 00:23:10,625
Look, these aren't a toy.

416
00:23:10,825 --> 00:23:12,661
They're a new type of handcuffs.

417
00:23:14,996 --> 00:23:16,431
Pretty amazing, right?

418
00:23:16,631 --> 00:23:19,367
I see. I get it, so take them off.

419
00:23:19,567 --> 00:23:21,303
Yes, and this key is...

420
00:23:21,503 --> 00:23:23,038
Huh?

421
00:23:33,281 --> 00:23:35,116
Take them off now.

422
00:23:35,317 --> 00:23:36,318
C-Chief.

423
00:23:36,518 --> 00:23:37,385
What's wrong?

424
00:23:37,819 --> 00:23:39,888
We can't take them off for a month?!

425
00:23:42,457 --> 00:23:45,827
What the hell are you playing at?

426
00:23:46,027 --> 00:23:49,130
-I'll die if I'm with the chief that long! -That's my line.

427
00:23:49,331 --> 00:23:51,666
He really never learns.

428
00:23:53,601 --> 00:23:56,004
TODAY'S DAMAGE REPORT

429
00:23:56,204 --> 00:24:00,942
ONE RACCOON DOG COSTUME
